# Mark binary assets explicitly. Without this, core.autocrlf=true on Windows
# lets git's text heuristic misclassify some binaries (the product catalog PDF
# is one) and rewrite their LF bytes to CRLF on checkout, corrupting the file.
*.pdf  binary
*.mp4  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.png  binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
